"Parse tree: root S, interior variables, leaves terminals/ε; yield = string; ↔ leftmost derivation.",
formalDefinition="A parse tree for G=(V,T,P,S): root labelled S; interior nodes labelled by variables; if A has children X₁…Xₖ then A→X₁…Xₖ∈P; leaves labelled by T∪{ε}. Yield = concatenation of leaves.",
notation="Tree with root S; yield(T).",
components=["Root","Interior nodes","Leaves","Yield"],
