"CFL closed: ∪, ·, *, reversal, homomorphism, ∩ regular; NOT closed: ∩, complement, difference.",
formalDefinition="If L₁,L₂ are CFLs then L₁∪L₂, L₁L₂, L₁*, L₁ᴿ and L₁∩R (R regular) are CFLs; L₁∩L₂ and L̄₁ need not be.",
notation="S→S₁|S₂; S→S₁S₂; S→S₁S|ε.",
